{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02E610","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"那一带有那么巨大的遗迹吗……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"JPN_QUESTIONING_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"你说过吧，关于哥斯达黎加的古代文明，还有很多不为人知的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你还说过那里滚着巨大的石球。那是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"AUX_NEXT_ROW_CONTENT_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"就是“哥斯达黎加石球”。大约50年前在哥斯达黎加丛林里发现了许多巨大的石球。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":"AUX_MANY_SPHERES_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"不过是石头，没什么稀奇的吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"就算它们几乎是完美的球体也一样？而且那些石球是花岗岩，硬度相当高。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_GRANITE_DETAIL_REJOINED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那或许能拿来设陷阱。既然这么圆，应该也很容易滚动……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Snake……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":11,"review_flag":""}]}